---
/**
 * Page-level layout tweak shared by the audience pages: the global rule for two-card bands (`.pp-two`).
 *
 * The mobile sticky CTA bar's behaviour used to live here; it is now shared by every landing page
 * (LandingLayout + src/scripts/stickycta.ts): the bar steps aside while the hero's primary CTA or the page's own CTA
 * band is in view, so a solid primary button is never shown twice in one viewport region.
 */
---

<style is:global>
  /* Two-card bands: two columns on desktop instead of two thirds of a three-column grid */
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .pp-two .grid-cards,
    .pp-two .model__list.model__list {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }
</style>
